sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator as Operator / Admin
    participant Antarmuka as Antarmuka Web
    participant Scheduler as APScheduler
    participant Server as Server (FastAPI)
    participant Perangkat as Perangkat Jaringan
    participant Destination as Destination (Local/Git/SMB/Telegram)
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Operator,DB: HKN-007, HKN-008 — Pemicu Backup (Jadwal atau Manual)

    alt Pemicu jadwal aktif
        Scheduler->>Server: Memanggil _scheduled_backup_runner(schedule_id)
        Server->>DB: Ambil Schedule dan device_ids
        DB-->>Server: Data jadwal, device_ids, destination_ids
        Server->>DB: Simpan JobRun dengan status running
        DB-->>Server: job_run tersimpan
    else Permintaan backup manual
        Operator->>Antarmuka: Menekan Backup Sekarang
        Antarmuka->>Server: POST /backups/trigger (require_operator_or_admin)
        Server->>Server: Periksa session token dan role
        Server->>DB: Catat audit TRIGGER
        DB-->>Server: Audit tersimpan
    end

    Note over Server,DB: HKN-008 — Pengambilan Konfigurasi melalui SSH

    Server->>DB: Ambil Device, Credential, dan destination_ids
    DB-->>Server: Data perangkat, kredensial terenkripsi, destination_ids
    Server->>Server: Dekripsi kredensial; pilih engine
    Server->>Perangkat: Buka koneksi SSH dan jalankan fetch_config

    alt Pengambilan konfigurasi berhasil
        Perangkat-->>Server: Teks konfigurasi atau hasil biner

        Note over Server,DB: HKN-015 — Versioning dan Perbandingan SHA-256

        Server->>Server: Hitung SHA-256 dari konfigurasi
        Server->>DB: Kueri backup sukses terakhir
        DB-->>Server: Hash sebelumnya
        Server->>Server: Bandingkan hash; tandai config_changed

        Note over Server,Destination: HKN-008, HKN-016 — Penyimpanan ke Destination

        loop Setiap destination aktif
            Server->>Destination: Simpan konfigurasi

            alt Penyimpanan berhasil
                Destination-->>Server: Path atau message_id
            else Error sementara
                Destination-->>Server: Exception (timeout, rate_limit)
                Server->>Server: Hitung backoff; tunggu jeda
                Server->>Destination: Percobaan ulang simpan
                Destination-->>Server: Hasil percobaan ulang
            else Error permanen
                Destination-->>Server: Exception (auth_failure, permission_denied)
                Server->>DB: Catat BackupFailure
                DB-->>Server: Failure tersimpan
            end
        end

        opt Semua destination gagal
            Server->>Server: Jalankan fallback lokal
        end

        Server->>DB: Simpan Backup (hash, timestamp, config_text, status)
        DB-->>Server: Backup tersimpan

        Note over Server,DB: HKN-009, HKN-010, HKN-015 — Notifikasi

        opt Konfigurasi berubah
            Server->>Server: Kirim notifikasi perubahan konfigurasi
        end

    else Pengambilan konfigurasi gagal
        Perangkat-->>Server: Exception (koneksi ditolak, timeout, auth gagal)
        Server->>DB: Simpan Backup dengan status failed; catat BackupFailure
        DB-->>Server: Tersimpan
        Server->>Server: Kirim notifikasi kegagalan diagnostik
    end

    Server->>DB: Perbarui JobRun (devices_success, devices_failed, status)
    DB-->>Server: JobRun diperbarui
    Server->>Server: Kirim notifikasi job

    alt Pemicu jadwal
        Note over Server: Eksekusi background selesai
    else Permintaan manual
        Server-->>Antarmuka: Redirect ke halaman backup
        Antarmuka-->>Operator: Tampilkan status hasil backup
    end
